==== RecoilDelayModifier ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Determines the recoil of the weapon. Affects the pause between shots.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
RecoilDelayModifier = -10.0,
</syntaxhighlight>
